  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the young woman, who is explicitly labeled as a 'cute kid' by the text overlay. This projection frames the user as identifying with or imagining themselves as the innocent, vulnerable subject of the meme, which is then contrasted with the hateful text below. The projection is implicit through the labeling and the emotional contrast, inviting the user to mentally inhabit the role of the 'cute kid' before the violent narrative is imposed.",
